{%- case gem_handle -%}

  {%- when 'navratana' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--navratana">
    <h2>Who Is Navratna For?</h2>
    <b> Navratna may be considered by those who:</b>
    <ul>
      <li>Prefer a balanced astrological approach rather than focusing on a single planetary influence</li>
      <li>Experience multiple planetary factors simultaneously</li>
      <li>Seek harmony, stability, and protection across different areas of life</li>
      <li>Feel pulled between competing priorities and desire greater balance</li>
      <li>Value a holistic approach within traditional Vedic astrology</li>
      <li>Wish to wear a gemstone combination representing the complete planetary spectrum</li>
     <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #c53030; margin-top: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>⚠️ Important:</strong>  Navratna should ideally be worn after proper astrological consultation.</p>
    </div>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {%- when 'upratnas' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--upratnas">
    <h2>Who Are Upratnas For?</h2>
    <b>For Those Seeking Balance Over Intensity</b>
    <p>Upratna may be considered by individuals who wish to engage with astrological gemstone traditions without immediately turning to rarer or more expensive primary gemstones.</p>
    <p>They are often chosen by those who prefer a gradual approach, value accessibility, or seek a gemstone that feels personally comfortable to wear. Some people are introduced to gemstone traditions through Upratnas before later exploring primary planetary gemstones, while others continue wearing Upratnas throughout their lives because they appreciate their simplicity and practicality.</p>
    <p>They may also appeal to collectors, spiritual seekers, and gemstone enthusiasts who value the symbolism, history, and natural beauty of these stones beyond astrology alone.</p>
    <p>Not every journey requires intensity.</p>
    <p>Sometimes suitability matters more than strength.</p>
  </div>

  {%- when 'sacred-essentials' -%}
  <div class="gem-tab gem-tab--sacred_essentials">
    <h2>Who Is  Sacred Essentials For?</h2>
    <b>For Those Seeking Balance Over Intensity</b>
  </div>

  {%- else -%}
  <div class="gem-tab">
    <p>[Placeholder] Content coming soon.</p>
  </div>

{%- endcase -%}
